      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The village officially incorporated in 1885, marking its transition from a planned settlement to an incorporated municipality.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ransom%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "After a devastating fire, Ransom erected a 68‑foot water tower in 1896, becoming the centerpiece of its new public waterworks.",
